@startuml Background Task Execution

!define C4Container
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Container.puml

title Background Task Execution - Sequence Diagram

participant "Backend API\n[Container: FastAPI]" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL\n[Container: Database]" as Database
participant "Pod-Deployer\n[Container: Python]" as Worker
participant "Kubernetes-API\n[External System]" as K8s

Database -> Worker: NOTIFY task_queued\n(Worker holt die Task:\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
activate Worker

Worker -> Database: Lease auf der Task-Zeile,\nstatus = RUNNING
Database --> Backend: Trigger task_events_notify\n(NOTIFY task_events)
note right
  Backend streamt die Events
  per SSE an das Frontend
  (GET /deployments/{id}/stream)
end note

Worker -> Worker: SPEC_LOAD\nappstore.yaml aus dem Job\nerneut validieren

Worker -> K8s: K8S_NAMESPACE\nNamespace dep-<8 hex> anlegen\n(Label deployment-id)
activate K8s
K8s --> Worker: Namespace angelegt
deactivate K8s

Worker -> K8s: K8S_POLICIES\nResourceQuota, LimitRange,\nNetworkPolicies
Worker -> K8s: K8S_APPLY\nWorkloads (StatefulSet, Service, Ingress)\nbzw. VM per Server-Side Apply
activate K8s

Worker -> K8s: K8S_WAIT_READY\nSnapshot abfragen\n(Pods / VMIs bereit?)
K8s --> Worker: Pods bereit
deactivate K8s

Worker -> Database: Fortschritt und Logzeilen\nals Events in task_events\n(in jeder Phase)

Worker -> Worker: OUTPUTS_AND_CLEANUP\nZugangsdaten und Links bauen\n(Passwörter generieren)

Worker -> Database: Status SUCCESS, finished_at,\nversiegelte Ergebnisse\n(tasks.outputs_enc, Fernet)
deactivate Worker

Database --> Backend: NOTIFY task_events (Terminal-Event)
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: Reconciler / task_finalizer\nerledigt die Folgearbeit genau einmal
Backend -> Database: Deployment-Status aktualisieren
deactivate Backend

note over Worker, K8s
  Bricht der Worker ab (kill -9), erkennt der Reconciler den Ablauf der Lease:
  Task endet als FAILED (worker_lost), kein zweiter Lauf.
  Cancel: POST /deployments/{id}/cancel setzt cancel_requested_at und sendet
  NOTIFY task_cancel; der Worker prüft es in jeder Warteschleife.
end note

@enduml
